  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "After some time after joining an instance I see all avatars suddenly stop moving and their voices disappear too. But the game doesn't freeze entirely or crash, I can open the menu, move and interact with the world but only locally, other players see me as frozen as well. If I try to go to another world (e.g. go home) then there is only a black screen. So I have to restart the game and rejoin the instance to get back.\n\nToday (05 Oct 2024) it happened to me more than 10 times within 3 hours. I didn't have any problems like this before.\n\nAt least 1 more person I talked to in the instance had the same problem, it occurred 4 times during the same period of time.\n\nSince it looks like a network issue it's worth mentioning that the instance where it happened was located in Japan. I didn't have much time to test other locations.\n\nI'll attach one of the log files here but it doesn't seem to be very useful in this situation.\n\nMy setup:\n\nI use PICO 4 connected wirelessly to my PC through Pico Streaming Assistant. PC specs can be found in the logs. That 1 person I asked about the problem also uses PICO 4. Though I don't know if this is relevant.",
